{
  "version": 1,
  "notes": "TOTEM-style keymap for Corone 46\n\nKey positions (L=left R=right):\n  L-R0: outer(0) Q(1) W(2) E(3) R(4) T(5) inner(6)\n  L-R1: outer(7) A(8) S(9) D(10) F(11) G(12) inner(13)\n  L-R2: outer(14) Z(15) X(16) C(17) V(18) B(19)\n  L-Thumb: t0(20) t1(21) t2(22)\n  R-R0: inner(23) Y(24) U(25) I(26) O(27) P(28) outer(29)\n  R-R1: inner(30) H(31) J(32) K(33) L(34) ;(35) outer(36)\n  R-R2: N(37) M(38) ,(39) .(40) /(41) outer(42)\n  R-Thumb: t3(43) t4(44) t5(45)\n\nLayers:\n  0: Base (Windows)\n  1: Num  - numbers / arrows / symbols\n  2: Fn   - F-keys / Windows snap\n  3: Mac  - Ctrl->Cmd, ESC->MacFn\n  4: MacFn - Mac snap shortcuts\n\nTap Dance (set in Vial GUI > Tap Dance):\n  TD(0): tap=LShift  double=CapsLock\n  TD(1): tap=RShift  double=Quote\n\nCombos (set in Vial GUI > Combos):\n  J + K -> OSM(MOD_LGUI)\n  D + F -> OSM(MOD_LALT)\n\nMac toggle: top-left outer key (pos 0) = TG(3)\n\nMacro 0 (Vial GUI > Macros): Home + Shift+End",
  "documentation": "Corone 46 TOTEM-style layout.",
  "keyboard": "corone",
